	<<link [[Refuse|Sewers Collar Refuse]]>><</link>>
	<br>

<<elseif $rng gte 71 and pcAreArmsBound("any")>>
	"Now how'd you get like that, <<charles>>?" Morgan asks, poking at your bindings. "You shouldn't be playing with rope, you could hurt yourself." <<He>> produces a pair of rusty gardening shears. "Don't be shy, let <<mummy>> take care of it."
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Allow|Sewers Bindings]]>><<unbind>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>><<pain 6>><</link>><<gtrauma>><<gstress>><<gpain>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Refuse|Sewers Collar Refuse]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $rng gte 61 and !$daily.morgan.bath>>
	"Look at that, <<charles>>. It's just about bath time!" Morgan says. <<He>> grabs you by the arm and begins to march towards one of the many piles of scavenged garbage around.
	<br><br>
	<<He>> rummages through the pile, eventually uncovering a relatively large steel drum. It's big enough that a person could stand inside and only have their chest and head out. Morgan heaves it up with <<his>> bare hands, tipping it over and spilling the knicknacks and still water that had sat inside, then sets it on the ground once again.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Sewers Bathtime Start]]>><<set $daily.morgan.bath to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $rng gte 51>>
	"I'm going to bake scones," Morgan says, clutching a soggy bag of some damp, expired flour. Rats scuttle around <<his>> feet. "You put the kettle on."
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Help (1:00)|Sewers Scones]]>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>><<npcincr Morgan love 1>><<pass 60>><</link>><<gtrauma>><<gstress>>
