	<br>
	<<if isPubfameTaskAccepted("morgan")>>
		<<link [[Ask Morgan for the USB|Sewers Ask]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>

<<elseif $rng gte 41>>
	Morgan offers some advice. "Don't go swimming here without a top on," <<he>> says. "There are nasty parasites living in the water."
	<br><br>

	<<He>> turns away from you. "Help me search through these antiques," <<he>> says as <<he>> rummages through a pile of rubbish. "Don't be a bad <<girl>>, come help."
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Help (1:00)|Sewers Rummage]]>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>><<npcincr Morgan love 1>><<pass 60>><</link>><<gtrauma>><<gstress>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Refuse|Sewers Spank]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><<npcincr Morgan love -1>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if isPubfameTaskAccepted("morgan")>>
		<<link [[Ask Morgan for the USB|Sewers Ask]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>

<<elseif $rng gte 31 and C.npc.Morgan.love gte 51>>
	"<<charles>>," Morgan giggles. "My darling, <<if $worn.upper.type.includes("formal") and $worn.lower.type.includes("formal")>>
	I appreciate the attempt, but your clothes leave much to be desired. Someone of our name should aspire for better heights, don't you think?"
	<<else>>
	you should wear something that reflects well on our name. You don't want to be confused with a commoner, do you?" 
	<</if>>
	<<He>> rubs your shoulders with a little too much force, and walks you towards a rat nested pile of rags. <<gstress>>
	<br><br>

	"Don't worry, <<mummy>> has all your favourite little outfits down here." <<He>> shoves <<his>> hand inside the pile, shaking it side to side, until <<he>> produces a <<if $player.gender_appearance is "m">>frayed waistcoat and some frayed suit trousers<<else>>frayed rococo midi dress.<</if>>
	<br><br>
	Morgan buries <<his>> head on the fabric and inhales. "This! This was the one!" <<He>> rubs the clothes all over <<his>> face. "I love how this one looked on you… My <<charles>>, would you wear it again for me? 
	<<if $bodysize is 3>>
		If it's too tight I can patch it for you."
	<<elseif $bodysize is 2>>
		I'm sure it still fits."
	<<else>>
		If it's too loose I can get it fitted for you."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $uncomfortable.nude is true>>
		<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
			"B-but, there's no privacy here," you mumble, "where do I change?" 
		<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
			"I'm not taking my clothes off in front of you." You hug your body, as if trying to prevent your clothes from running away.
		<<else>>
			"Is there any place I can undress?" you ask, searching around with your eyes.
		<</if>>
		Morgan scoffs, "Don't be ridiculous, <<charles>>. It's nothing I haven't seen already." 
		<br><br> 
	<</if>>
	<<if hasSexStat("exhibitionism", 3)>>
		<<link [[Accept clothes|Sewers Outfit Wear]]>><</link>><<exhibitionist3>><<npcincr Morgan love 3>><<glove>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
