You let Morgan help you undress. <<His>> mumbles are incomprehensible, but you catch some badmouthing about your clothes. Once <<he>>'s done, <<he>> tears and discards them all into the rag pile.<<gstress>>
<br><br>
Morgan eyes you up and down. "Good, good! You look marvelous, my <<=$phase is 0 ? "Charles" : "Charlene">>. Befitting for our family."
<br><br>
<<if $phase is 0>>
	Morgan picks up the suit trousers and carefully rolls up one of the legs. <<He>> kneels in front of you, spreading the fabric with both hands.
	<br><br>
	"Raise your leg, my boy." <<He>> gestures at you.
<<else>>
	Morgan picks up the rococo midi dress and carefully rolls it up. <<He>> raises it on top of you, spreading the fabric with both hands.
	<br><br>
	"Raise your arms, my girl." <<He>> gestures you to copy <<him>>.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Sewer Outfit Wear Help 2]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Sewer Outfit Wear Help 2
/* ============ 번역 필요 ============== */
<<effects>><<set $location to "sewers">><<set $outside to 0>>
<<if $phase is 0>>
	<<lowerwear "suit trousers">>
	<<upperwear "waistcoat">>
	<<set $worn.upper.integrity -= 20>>
	<<set $worn.lower.integrity -= 20>>
	<<set _clothes_torn to true>>
	<<effects>>
	Using <<his>> shoulders as support, you raise your leg and let Morgan slide the garment up, <<his>> thumb brushing along your inner thigh. 
	<<He> repeats the process with your other leg. Once done, <<he>> pulls your pants up a little too tight. <<gpain>><<garousal>>
	<br><br>
	<<He>> continues, guiding each of your arms through the waistcoat sleeves and passing your stuck head through the neckline. When you're freed, <<he>>'s standing way closer than <<he>> was before. <<His>> shaky hands brush off some hair strands that fell onto your face.
	<br><br>
	The clothes are soft and warm enough to keep you protected from the sewer's chilly air.<<lstress>>
<<else>>
	<<upperwear "rococo midi dress">>
	<<set $worn.upper.integrity -= 20>>
	<<set $worn.lower.integrity -= 20>>
	<<set _clothes_torn to true>>
	<<effects>>
	You raise your hands up. Morgan catches your wrists with the sleeves, and slides the garment down. <<His>> fingers brush along the length of your arms.<<garousal>>
	<br><br>
	<<He>> drops the rest of the fabric. However, your head is still stuck, so you let Morgan pass it through the neckline. When you're freed, <<he>>'s standing way closer than <<he>> was before. <<His>> shaky hands brush off some hair strands that fell onto your face.
	<br><br>
	The rococo midi dress skirt flows above your legs, keeping them protected from the sewer's chilly air. <<lstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
Morgan looks ecstatic. "Oh, <<charles>>. You look like a dream," <<he>> says, covering <<his>> mouth with both hands. "This was your <<mummy>>'s favorite for a reason."
<br><br>
Suddenly, Morgan pulls you into a tight hug. <<He>> <<if $bodysize is 3>>tries to pick you up, unsuccessfully. <<He>> pulls your head down to cover<<else>>picks you up, swinging you around and covering<</if>> your face in wet kisses.
<br><br>
"I couldn't have asked for a better <<pdaughter>>!" <<he>> squeals. After what feels like an eternity, <<he>> lets you go.
<br><br>
"I'd love to try more clothes on you, but if you excuse me, <<mummy>> has a kitchen to attend to. I don't want our <<= either("tea to get cold", "scones to get burnt")>>."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Sewers Morgan]]>><</link>>
